{"id":"480c0affb5c0ccd9","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Extender Sequence Coherence","display":"df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence — ZFC Inner4 Extender Sequence Coherence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence — ZFC Inner4 Extender Sequence Coherence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-extender-sequence]]","[[58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence — ZFC Inner4 Extender Sequence Coherence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e645227245eab34\" href=\"?note=1e645227245eab34\" title=\"58-df-zfc-extender-sequence\">58-df-zfc-extender-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6be11bd4251b6ed3\" href=\"?note=6be11bd4251b6ed3\" title=\"58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md\">58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\vec E\\in V\">\\(M,\\vec E\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的类型由实际依赖 <code>58-df-zfc-extender-sequence</code> 限定为传递集合模型。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec E\">\\(\\vec E\\)</span> (extender sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> (metalinguistic class-quantifier domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,E)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-set-extender-coherence-data</code> 的集合外延转接。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-class-quotient-collapse</code> 的显式成员良基关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S\\)</span> (extender-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e645227245eab34\" href=\"?note=1e645227245eab34\" title=\"58-df-zfc-extender-sequence\">58-df-zfc-extender-sequence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ExtenderSequenceCoherence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ExtenderSequenceCoherence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (class-level predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}coherence}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ExtenderSequenceCoherence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M)\\land\\vec E\\in M\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}N,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,\\vec E(\\alpha))\\land\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\land j(\\vec E)\\upharpoonright\\alpha=\\vec E\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}coherence}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ExtenderSequenceCoherence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M)\\land\\vec E\\in M\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}N,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,\\vec E(\\alpha))\\land\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\land j(\\vec E)\\upharpoonright\\alpha=\\vec E\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Extender ultrapowers are not the ultrafilter quotient supplied by <code>df-ultrapower</code>; the construction and class embedding are therefore kept explicitly at the metalevel.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-extender-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"1e645227245eab34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-extender-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"6be11bd4251b6ed3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set-extender-coherence-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-extender-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"1e645227245eab34","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S$ (extender-sequence predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-extender-sequence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\vec E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ExtenderSequenceCoherence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}extender\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}coherence}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ExtenderSequenceCoherence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\vec E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExtenderSequence}_S(\\vec E,M)\\land\\vec E\\in M\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}N,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,N,M,\\vec E(\\alpha))\\land\\mathrm{WellFoundedMembership}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\land j(\\vec E)\\upharpoonright\\alpha=\\vec E\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1859,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2383","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence.md|58-df-zfc-inner4-extender-sequence-coherence]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1e645227245eab34","6be11bd4251b6ed3"]}